 --i Casting over base level, additional information required; Which damage type do you wish to increase?|q;Preference;Upcast which damage type|acid|cold
 --=Upcast|[$CastLevel.Raw] - 3
 --=dice|2 + [$Upcast.Raw]
 --? [&Preference] -eq acid|&aciddam;[$dice]d6|&aciddam;2d6
 --? [&Preference] -eq cold|&colddam;[$dice]d6|&colddam;2d6
